# Edemint localepurge — keep these locales; purge everything else (§optim).
# Trims ~150MB off the installed system / ISO. Users with other locales
# can `dpkg-reconfigure localepurge` and pick more.
USE_DPKG
SHOWFREEDSPACE
QUICKNDIRTY
VERBOSE
NEEDSCONFIGFIRST

en
en_US
en_US.UTF-8
en_GB
en_GB.UTF-8
